    "detailed_description": "If you find any bugs or requirements, you can leave a message in the STEAM community<br />\r\nI will continuously optimize this game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate, collect, play is the heart of this board game, and we're committed to creating an online museum of playable chess! <br />\r\nCreate your own chess game, customise the rules, pieces, board, look and feel, and enjoy a game like no other!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1) Customize the rules, pieces, board and appearance<br />\r\n2) 20+ preset classic board games<br />\r\n3) Open creative workshop, upload your creations and play with other people's ideas<br />\r\n4) A chess game feature that records and plays back every move you make<br />\r\n5) The ability to play with friends online and offline<br />\r\n6) reality mode, move, put and take away pieces at will, so that ideas are not bound by the program",
    "about_the_game": "If you find any bugs or requirements, you can leave a message in the STEAM community<br />\r\nI will continuously optimize this game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate, collect, play is the heart of this board game, and we're committed to creating an online museum of playable chess! <br />\r\nCreate your own chess game, customise the rules, pieces, board, look and feel, and enjoy a game like no other!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1) Customize the rules, pieces, board and appearance<br />\r\n2) 20+ preset classic board games<br />\r\n3) Open creative workshop, upload your creations and play with other people's ideas<br />\r\n4) A chess game feature that records and plays back every move you make<br />\r\n5) The ability to play with friends online and offline<br />\r\n6) reality mode, move, put and take away pieces at will, so that ideas are not bound by the program",
    "short_description": "Create, collect and play board games from around the world, you can customise board sizes, piece moves and their unique look. There's 20+ classic board games and countless future games of yours!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
